2f:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-col","children":[["$","div","pianyijichang/qifancloud",{"className":"border-t border-rule py-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl font-semibold","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/pianyijichang/qifancloud","className":"text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline","children":"起帆Cloud"}]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted","children":["¥9.9/月起 · 2000G/月","　·　每 GB ¥0.0033"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted","children":"2023 年开业的超大流量平价机场，每月 2000G 只要 9.9 元，折合每 GB 半分钱，是本站价格最低的一档。它没跑路：面板正常、文档两周前还在更新、跑路名单里查不到。真正的问题有三个：官网 www.qf1.us 这个主机名被墙，大陆直连打不开（换 panel.qf1.us 就秒开，官方自己没说）；官方公告里指定的防失联发布页 ncfb.github.io 已经 404，那套失联预案是废的；三档套餐的季付半年付年付全部等于月付乘周期数，零折扣。适合会换域名、只买月付的人当大流量备用线，不适合怕折腾的新手当唯一主力。"}]]}],["$","div","pianyijichang/xingchenvpn",{"className":"border-t border-rule py-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl font-semibold","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/pianyijichang/xingchenvpn","className":"text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline","children":"星辰VPN"}]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted","children":["¥8/月起 · 80G/月","　·　每 GB ¥0.042"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted","children":"星辰VPN(xcvpn)当前正常运营,价格在平价档确实有竞争力:80G 月付 8 元、100G 月付 9.9 元,每 GB 约 0.1 元,标准版以上标称含 IEPL 专线。但有三件事必须先知道:一是它的站点 logo 与 AI 客服脚本,和「西游云」挂在同一批服务器上,而西游那块牌子 2024 年 10 月跑路过一次——这只能证明共用基础设施,不等于同一家公司,但你有权知道;二是它后台的限速字段比套餐宣传低,标「最高500M」的实际是 400M,标「速率不限制」的年付档实际也是 400M;三是官网主域在国内被 DNS 污染,进不去是常态。价格可以试,建议只月付。"}]]}],["$","div","iplc/flashfox",{"className":"border-t border-rule py-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl font-semibold","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/iplc/flashfox","className":"text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline","children":"闪狐云 FlashFox"}]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted","children":["¥20/月起 · 120G/月","　·　每 GB ¥0.1"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted","children":"价格结构干净的中价专线机场：四档套餐、六个付费周期，压周期是真折扣（年付 8 折、三年 6 折），套餐页也没有藏倍率。但有两件事要先掂量：limbo 跑路名单里挂着一条 2026 年 6 月的预警 issue 至今没结案（内容是「刚充上就是全红、客服没人理」，但举报者没交任何佐证），以及它的工单系统实际停用，售后只剩右下角一个网页聊天窗——没有工单就没有可追溯的售后记录。适合月付试水，不适合押长周期。"}]]}],["$","div","pianyijichang/pakeyun",{"className":"border-t border-rule py-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl font-semibold","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/pianyijichang/pakeyun","className":"text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline","children":"帕克云"}]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted","children":["¥15/月起 · 100G/月","　·　每 GB ¥0.12"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted","children":"少见的把入口做在国内的机场：面板域名解析到中国移动网内，六个官网地址大陆全部秒开、注册购买都不需要先有梯子，文档中心 27 篇更新到 2026 年 7 月，客户端和一键导入做得比同价位完整。代价是三条：全部套餐写明「仅限中国大陆地区使用」，海外用不了；年付就是月付乘 12、一分不省，最贵的 Ultra 档甚至压根没有年付选项；不限时买断包每 GB 要 0.33 元起，是月付档的两倍多。适合怕折腾的新手按月付用，别买年付也别买买断包。"}]]}],["$","div","pianyijichang/huojiantnt",{"className":"border-t border-rule py-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl font-semibold","children":["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/pianyijichang/huojiantnt","className":"text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline","children":"火箭TNT"}]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted","children":["¥22/月起 · 100G/月","　·　每 GB ¥0.08"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-7 text-muted","children":"运营多年的老牌机场（最早可查官方域名注册于 2020 年 8 月），未进任何跑路名单。套餐设计有两处坑：经济舱 ¥22 与商务舱 ¥23 只差一块钱、流量与设备却差一倍；「IPLC线路VIP节点」这行字印在每张套餐卡上，但便宜三档前面是灰色叉号。压周期零折扣，月付即最优解。"}]]}],"$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35"]}]
